{"id":"composer_000017","name":"马克斯·布鲁赫","originalName":"Max Bruch","aliases":["布鲁赫","Max Bruch","Bruch"],"birthYear":1838,"deathYear":1920,"nationality":"德国","period":"浪漫主义","introduction":"德国浪漫主义作曲家、指挥家，科隆出身。在瓦格纳风潮席卷德语世界的年代，他坚守门德尔松式的旋律传统，写有歌剧、清唱剧与三部小提琴协奏曲。g小调第一小提琴协奏曲是十九世纪最受欢迎的小提琴协奏曲之一，但他很早便把版权贱卖，未能从其长销中获益。","styleSummary":"旋律宽广温暖，配器明晰，是晚期浪漫主义中的保守抒情一路。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-max-bruch","title":"Max Bruch","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Max_Bruch","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000046","composerId":"composer_000017","composerName":"马克斯·布鲁赫","title":"g小调第一小提琴协奏曲","originalTitle":"Violin Concerto No. 1 in G minor, Op. 26","opus":"Op. 26","genre":"小提琴协奏曲","periodKey":"romantic","genreFamily":"concerto","durationMinutes":26,"difficulty":"第一次听","tags":["布鲁赫","小提琴协奏曲","浪漫主义","德国","旋律"],"summary":"布鲁赫1866年写成、经约阿希姆建议修订的g小调小提琴协奏曲，是十九世纪旋律最丰美的协奏曲之一，慢板乐章几乎无人不被打动。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_75edda0e02911305"],"upcomingEventCount":1}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_75edda0e02911305"],"upcomingEventCount":1}